#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><important><para>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-kconfig.xml:37
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package is extracted from the KF6 set of packages.  If <xref "
"linkend=\"kf6-frameworks\"/> is built, do <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">NOT</emphasis> also build this package as presented here."
